<div class="body">
  <div class="section-title">Three steps. Any Claude account.</div>
  <div class="section-sub">No installation, no code, no terminal.</div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-title">Download SKILL.md</div><div class="step-body">One file. Contains the full framework, instructions, and methodology. Free.</div><button onclick="downloadSkill()" style="background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);border:none;padding:9px 18px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:var(--radius);cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px;">&#8595; Download</button></div>
    <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-title">Upload to Claude</div><div class="step-body">Go to claude.ai and start a new conversation. Click the paperclip icon and upload the SKILL.md file.</div><span class="step-code">claude.ai &rarr; New chat &rarr; paperclip &rarr; upload SKILL.md</span></div>
    <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-title">Run it</div><div class="step-body">Type the prompt below. Claude walks you through gathering role details, then generates both documents.</div><span class="step-code">Run this skill for [job title] at [company name]</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:8px">What it generates</div>
  <div class="section-sub">Two complete documents calibrated to your leveling framework, job family, competencies, and company values.</div>
  <div class="skill-grid" style="margin-bottom:52px">
    <div class="skill-card" style="--card-accent:#b8935a;grid-column:span 2;"><div class="claude-chip">Document 1</div><div class="skill-name" style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px">Work Experience Description</div><div class="skill-desc" style="font-size:12px">Written in second person around all 8 key relationships: Company Summary &middot; What your experience will be &middot; Why you belong here and how you will grow &middot; What success looks like &middot; What you will bring &middot; How this work affects your life &middot; Compensation structure</div></div>
